"""Group E: second-pass semantic decisions for source columns not matched by name.
key (source_no, column) -> (code, value)
code S = covered by semantically equivalent blueprint column(s) (value = blueprint column)
code G = gap: column to add (value = proposed column definition; tag GAP/RECOMMENDATION in Part 3.6)
code C = conflict: value = proposed resolution
code N = not adopted: value = reason"""
O = {}
def s(no, col, v): O[(no, col)] = ('S', v)
def g(no, col, v): O[(no, col)] = ('G', v)
def c(no, col, v): O[(no, col)] = ('C', v)
def n(no, col, v): O[(no, col)] = ('N', v)
